{"time": 1758204136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140690912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（1个小时的文戏只推进了不到20句台词）"}
{"time": 1758204164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1747215999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "正当你们聊一半的时候，温特来了“封夜小姐，香风小姐，我们去无眠机关找御史大人吧”"}
{"time": 1758204205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627901616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“好！我已经迫不及待了”"}
